	(text "USB2514BI HUB, I2C-EEPROM config mode: CFG_SEL[1:0] = 11 (pull-ups on pins 24, 25).\nStraps are ignored in this mode - the 24LC02B carries: all 4 ports non-removable, OC sensing unused,\nself-powered, VID/PID 0424/2514, serial number set. TEST to GND. No port power switches.\nPORT SWAP: downstream D+/D- are crossed at pins 1-4 and 6-9 for routing - set PRTSP (0xFA) bits 1-4\n= 0x1E in the EEPROM image, or ports 1-4 will not enumerate.\nR28 (SCL / CFG_SEL0 pull-up) is also the strap: firmware must release SCL/SDA before HUB_MR_N.\nNOTE: record lists 0.01 uF + 0.1 uF on CRFILT/PLLFILT; the USB2514B datasheet asks for >= 1.0 uF\nlow-ESR on each - fitted 1 uF + 100 nF here. Confirm against the datasheet."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 150 22 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "02dddaf5-3099-588c-a127-7cc30e744e60")
	)
	(text "TEST POINTS - hub"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 23 266 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "44770c2a-66ef-5a71-a049-689a193ca110")
	)
	(text "USB-C UPSTREAM. PRTR5V0U2F routed THROUGH (pins 1/6 one channel, 3/4 the other) - no stub.\nChosen over USBLC6 for its GND-VCC diode: protected with no host / no VBUS present.\nCC1/CC2 terminate in 5.1k Rd only. A6/B6 and A7/B7 tied for either orientation."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 22 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "5ce16d77-4a3f-5d75-aac3-c7d1877f3a48")
	)
	(text "Hub config EEPROM - private bus. Never on the inter-board harness:\nthree 24LC02Bs at 0xA0 and three hub masters would collide."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 300 160 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "6b6debdb-81aa-52ee-beef-79acf751c92e")
	)
